  "title": "Vertiv Achieves Highest Rating in CRNs 2023 Annual Report Card (ARC) Awards for Power Protection and Management Category",
  "summary": "Vertiv (NYSE: VRT), a global provider of critical digital infrastructure and continuity solutions, today announced that CRN®, a brand of The Channel Company, has named it as the winner in the Power Protection and Management category of the 2023 CRN Annual Report Card (ARC) Awards, with Vertiv also leading in all related subcategories. Powered by groundbreaking products, services, and partner programs, this award recognizes the industry's top technology vendors.",
